com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyYuNTQsXvL7xpKZnnxSqU2oAAao96H4VZkZ2YsJzdtsg&oe=69BA95CD"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1021011425999827", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_1021011429333160_4176289926510597494_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QWWM-lOYJaQQ7kNvwFat9gi&_nc_oc=AdnxIz-iw5VLoXKmZ4MbSCfXwmcvuXkNFRFJUFmXVSRSH1dvq7QrcThkMp68ykWfNh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxj_JpqC-bPZbbrFn94RELlyG8QjifL5F-acN5qEPo-SA&oe=69BA8B61"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 4.png", "id": "524012790104112", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001669_524012793437445_4891316513078544414_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zqk6Uh9Nf6cQ7kNvwHTamq7&_nc_oc=AdnlttcnBpAxClJ1QYKcY8d3Eq--kQlOGy7j3SXb2n0srMAMmsaII-VTZ-OIoRl9xh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw-KMpt0tlEjr-WPl7G2XUnzIkpI5p4_J-KXFNZphZDrQ&oe=69BA9FDA"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3.png", "id": "1187574142495669", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031470_1187574145829002_8495108821353233334_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bGMhbe2tBq8Q7kNvwGO8g5i&_nc_oc=Adm73-F0WN7czhgP4M7XU0Vc_lZNvcoVC7ec4oAITQLo6Ir9VXpivPrvgwXv6TLxeKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw07qUBNRPJZglENhv10J03EZHjLaEt36_2Estoa7IUYw&oe=69BA9270"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974450_2251639131854765_8396477208328520911_n.png", "id": "529809686395654", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476759_529809689728987_2021663405477506286_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r3Da6_OSXqgQ7kNvwEwFGeE&_nc_oc=AdlOwQ6bkPV_bYUIhzUhkNxS1qbPWJ7VrQytIu0nos0CSlu-mIDDhvlYpBh5CEBlClA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyqvqN5Do4lNrp0XaL2IQw-M6o_DKvFFevhIcOMbcpacw&oe=69BA847F"}, "display_name": "Cellular Safari", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Safari Cellular** is an innovative virtual reality app that turns learning about **cellular biology** into an exciting adventure. Designed for **students, educators and science enthusiasts**, this app allows you to explore an **animal cell in 3D** like never before. Through an immersive interface, you can navigate through different cell structures, such as **the nucleus, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum**, discovering their functions and importance.\n\nEach component of the cell is represented in stunning detail, allowing you to observe and understand complex biological processes in a visually engaging way. **Integrated artificial intelligence** is at your disposal to answer any questions you may have while exploring, providing clear and detailed explanations.\n\nCellular Safari is not just a passive educational experience; it includes a series of **mini interactive games** designed to consolidate your knowledge in a fun and engaging way. Through **challenges and quizzes**, you can test your understanding of biological concepts, making learning an active and stimulating process.\n\nPerfect for use in education or as a self-study tool, Cellular Safari offers a new and innovative way to explore the microscopic world of the animal cell. With **high-quality graphics** and an **intuitive user experience**, this app turns the study of biology into an unforgettable adventure.", "short_description": "Discover the fascinating world of the animal cell with Cell Safari, the educational VR app that allows you to explore cell structures in 3D. Through interactive mini-games and advanced artificial intelligence, learn scientific concepts while having fun. Ideal for students and biology enthusiasts, this immersive experience makes learning an exciting adventure."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape Mini.png", "id": "2930927027073306", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974477_2930927030406639_1033799740283778117_n.